== Usage ==
'''Heavy Pearls''' are primarily used to upgrade Weapons and Armor sets that are upgraded with {{Item|Crimson  Essence}}. They are also used in specific Quests.

== Trivia ==
*There was a period of time when [[The Matriarch]] was inaccessible: during this period the only way to obtain a Heavy Pearl was to again talk to {{NPCSprite|Gris}} after completing his quest, or salvage certain Armor pieces.

